Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||02-08-2001||11:09 PM||||If you're not familiar with what happened last year, please read this first..<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004746.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004746.html</A> <P>Just an update on this situation... the bank called yesterday, and this person's check has bounced.. it's been over 5 months now, you'd think they could manage to somehow pay me the lousy $45 (CDN) in this time period... there is NO reason why it should take this long. so to all of you who said you were glad this was resolved in december.. looks like it's not resolved yet after all.<P>p.s. I just realized that people might jump to conclusions since I've been asking about Fierodave recently.. that was about a totally different deal we have in the works.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||8
