Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||02-09-2001||03:21 AM||||I've emailed the person one more time, I sincerely hope this can be resolved once and for all..<BR>No matter what angle I think about this from, I just can't think of any reason to not be able to send the money, or at least give a valid reason not to, in the 5 months since this deal took place.<P>I'm not trying to cause trouble, nor be unfair to this person.. yet part of me thinks I would be doing both, if I went public and told everyone the full story. If anyone thinks I'm out of line, please let me know.. I've made a few goof ups as well, but I'm just a college student who runs a very small business in my spare time.. At the moment I DO owe stuff to 2 forum members. I owe 87EC05 $12.00, and I owe DXR_DAD a pair of quarter panel scoops. I haven't forgotten, and I'm sure they haven't either. At the moment, all my financial matters are being handled by my parents, and I'm not at home with access to my tools and workshop so the 1/4 scoops aren't ready.<P>Scott, I'm basically broke, but I don't think this is gonna financially ruin me, and I hate owing people money any longer than I have to.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> I'll ask my mom to buy and send a money order for me on monday. can you email me your postal address again?<P>DXR_DAD, no word on the scoops yet.. I need to buy myself a new dremel tool first.. probably a jigsaw too. depends what it takes to cut enduraflex cleanly.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||4
Z||000005||DXR_DAD||02-09-2001||10:56 AM||||As you know Steve it's no problem with me! We talk to each other often, so I'm sure you know that we have a understanding.<P>But as for this other guy!!!......well you know what I have to say about it. Your a nice guy for not saying who it is on the forum...BUT, 5 months????.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>There are lots of others that would like to know who he is. Just to protect others from doing business with him! if thats how he does business.<P>I said it in your last "Burned" post I do not get into these type topics and flame wars but this is a little much!!!!!!||||reg||10
Z||000006||KnightRyder31||02-09-2001||01:16 PM||||Hang him!!!!!!<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||DaRkLoRD||02-09-2001||03:16 PM||||I got an email from this person saying it was a bank error, and I'm willing to give him the benefit of the doubt and just wait for a new check or (hopefully) money order to arrive...<P>87EC05, I've asked my mom to get the money order, and she's going to mail it on monday afternoon.<P>DXR_DAD, yeah.. I just wanted to mention that I haven't forgotten about it. the panels are still in the box. As soon as I get some time to work on them (my basement is a mess... maybe it'll be warm enough on spring break to sit outside and work on them) I'll get them cleaned up, sanded, and do the fiberglass work.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||14
